<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of June 12.</p>
<p>				  June 12/June 11  June 12/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.02		 7.10</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.03		 5.39</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.02		10.15</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			   -0.03		55.15</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.21		31.84</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -0.25		32.28</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.27		13.48</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.77		30.35</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.17		39.55</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -0.22		37.93</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.31		22.65</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.73		97.95</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,307,260,933,213</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,943,175,868,484</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,024,816,191,071</p>
<p>  International funds			    96,421,316,424</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    242,847,557,234</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
